# BEGIN LOCAL-AGENT-BRIDGE
CortexIDE is running as a coding agent via Local Agent Bridge.
- Use Agent mode tools for any real work. Do not stop after a few calls. Call attempt_completion when done.
- Skills are slash-commands under .cortexide/skills (40 synced). Read a matching SKILL.md before following it.
- Canvases are .canvas.tsx files (42 found). Use the canvas skill before writing one.
